# Local Claude Code settings (machine-specific paths + tokens).
# Shared workflows under commands/ are versioned on purpose — they are not
# machine-specific. Note: .claude/* (not .claude/), otherwise git skips the
# whole directory and the exception below never applies.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/

# DB backups — contain customer data, never commit
